  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workforce Skills Development: Kiribati Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kiribati Australia Skills for Employment Partnership (KASfEP), referred to as the Kiribati Facility, will support the Government of Kiribati to provide labour market demand driven skills development to young people who seek to work in domestic, regional and international labour markets. The Kiribati Facility will assist the Kiribati Institute of Technology (KIT) to develop its capacity and services as a training institution for employment opportunities for I-Kiribati nationals. Assistance to KIT includes provision of additional local staff and advisors, courses and trainings, institution accreditation support, promoting GEDSI, and improving KIT&#x2019;s governance and coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
